---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const tools=[['🎟','Bingo Card Generator','Make printable or on-screen bingo cards from your own words, names or prompts.','/bingo-card-generator/'],['🔎','Word Search Generator','Turn a custom word list into a clean printable puzzle.','/word-search-generator/'],['👥','Random Team Generator','Split any list into fair random groups instantly.','/random-team-generator/'],['🎡','Decision Wheel','Spin custom choices, remove winners and decide in seconds.','/decision-wheel/'],['🏆','Tournament Bracket','Create a knockout bracket for games, classrooms and events.','/tournament-bracket-generator/'],['🎫','Raffle Ticket Maker','Generate numbered printable raffle tickets without accounts.','/raffle-ticket-generator/'],['🪑','Seating Chart Maker','Arrange names into rows and columns for classes or events.','/seating-chart-generator/'],['🏅','Certificate Maker','Create a simple printable certificate in your browser.','/certificate-maker/']];
---
<BaseLayout title="PARADOX Makers — Free Printable & Random Generators" description="Free browser generators for bingo cards, word searches, random teams, decision wheels, brackets, raffle tickets, seating charts and certificates. No account required.">
<main>
<section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">FREE GENERATORS · NO ACCOUNT</div><h1>Make the thing.<br><em>Print it. Share it.</em></h1><p>PARADOX Makers is a browser-first collection of useful generators for classrooms, parties, teams, events, games and everyday life. Create something in seconds, then get on with your day.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary" href="#tools">Explore generators ↓</a><a class="secondary" href="#why">Why it is free</a></div><div class="trust">✓ No signup · ✓ No paid API · ✓ Works on mobile · ✓ Print or save locally</div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="maker-poster"><span>PARADOX</span><strong>MAKE<br>IT.</strong><small>CLASSROOM · PARTY · WORK · LIFE</small></div></div></section>
<section class="quick"><div class="quick-inner"><div class="eyebrow light">MOST USEFUL</div><h2>Start with a problem, not a menu.</h2><div class="preset-row"><a class="preset" href="/bingo-card-generator/">BINGO</a><a class="preset" href="/word-search-generator/">WORD SEARCH</a><a class="preset" href="/random-team-generator/">TEAMS</a><a class="preset" href="/decision-wheel/">WHEEL</a><a class="preset" href="/tournament-bracket-generator/">BRACKET</a><a class="preset" href="/raffle-ticket-generator/">RAFFLE</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="tools"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">GENERATOR STUDIO</div><h2>Useful little<br><em>machines.</em></h2></div><p>Every page is an actual working generator, not a listicle. The output is created in your browser so the experience stays fast, private and free.</p></div><div class="tool-grid">{tools.map(([icon,name,desc,href],i)=><a class:list={['tool-card',i===0&&'featured']} href={href}><div class="tool-icon">{icon}</div><div><h3>{name}</h3><p>{desc}</p></div><div class="tool-link">Open generator ↗</div></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="section" id="guides"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">FREE GUIDES</div><h2>Make it<br><em>better.</em></h2></div><p>Original guides answer the practical questions around each generator: classroom setup, party ideas, printable formats, fair randomization and better worksheets.</p></div><div class="guide-grid"><a class="guide" href="/guides/bingo-cards/">How to make a bingo card that is actually fun ↗</a><a class="guide" href="/guides/word-searches/">How to build a readable word search ↗</a><a class="guide" href="/guides/random-teams/">How to split a group fairly ↗</a><a class="guide" href="/guides/printables/">How to print browser-made worksheets cleanly ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="section" id="why"><div class="why"><div class="eyebrow">WHY PARADOX MAKERS</div><h2>Free means actually free.</h2><p>We are building the opposite of a signup funnel. A visitor should be able to arrive from search, solve one specific problem, print or download the result, and leave without creating an account.</p><p>Generation happens locally in the browser, so there is no upload pipeline and no expensive AI or document API required for the core experience.</p><p>PARADOX earns through clearly separated advertising rather than charging people for basic utilities. The tools themselves remain accessible.</p></div></section>
</main></BaseLayout>
